      "tier": 1,
      "title": "PostgreSQL 19 Beta 里最能被感觉到的四项变化",
      "summary": "Christophe Pettus 挑出 PostgreSQL 19 里最能被感觉到的四项变化：MultiXact 成员计数器扩到 64 位，高并发共享行锁不再耗尽四十亿成员空间、逼出停机 vacuum；autovacuum 可以并行处理索引，代价是每个工作进程各占一份 maintenance_work_mem；UPDATE 与 DELETE 支持 FOR PORTION OF，按子区间改写时段行；jit 默认关闭，靠代码生成的 OLAP 需要显式打开。",
      "url": "https://thebuild.com/blog/postgresql-19-beta-the-four-features-youll-actually-feel/",
      "author": "Christophe Pettus",
      "source": "thebuild.com",
      "source_date": "2026-05-18",
      "image": "https://thebuild.com/media/media/89009977ed2d464a907d6be10f6df32c_0.png",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "PostgreSQL 19",
        "新特性"
      ],
      "position": 1
